{"ID":"20260902171815-ujd5riw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-ujd5riw","title":"mcp-windbg秋招面试准备笔记","type":"doc","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260902171815-ht3niv2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-ht3niv2","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"mcp-windbg 秋招面试准备笔记"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-d3g086e","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-d3g086e","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260902171815-ddyr9cu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-ddyr9cu","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用范围："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mcp-windbg"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 项目下当前活跃子项目 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cdb_analysis_server/"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（远程 Windows Crash Dump 分析服务，7 个 MCP 工具 + 3 个 prompts + REST API + Web 调试页面 + 流式上传）。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-vv58hxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-vv58hxt","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本笔记参考 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"笔试面试.md"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中音视频项目的组织方式，按模块整理秋招面试问答。每个问题的回答都是口语化、简洁、可直接口述的满分回答，全部围绕项目真实源码（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"core/cdb_session.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"core/session_manager.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"core/file_manager.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"core/output_filter.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"core/output_parser.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"core/presets.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"core/disk_cleaner.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"core/metadata_store.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tools/*.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"api/*.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"main.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"config.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）展开，不引入项目外能力。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-u1uf73k","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-u1uf73k","updated":"20260902171815"}},{"ID":"20260902171815-18x07pk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-18x07pk","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 1：整体架构与选型"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-41rc6yu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-41rc6yu","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目是做什么的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-v2fh98t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-v2fh98t","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我参与的是一个基于 Python 的远程 Windows Crash Dump 分析服务。服务端部署在一台装了 Windows CDB/WinDbg 调试器的机器上，对外同时提供 MCP、REST API 和 Web 三种访问方式。用户只需要把 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".dmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 崩溃转储文件传上来，服务端就通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"FileManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 做流式落盘和 SHA1 去重，再由 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SessionManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 启动并维护常驻的 CDB 调试进程，执行 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!heap -s"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这些调试命令。CDB 的原始输出会经过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"output_filter"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清洗、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"output_parser"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和 preset 解析成结构化的 JSON，最后配合 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MetadataStore"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"DiskCleaner"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 做访问元数据、过期 dump 清理和 LRU 淘汰，让服务长期跑也不会把磁盘撑爆。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-jobl9x6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-jobl9x6","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"介绍一下项目整体架构，从客户端到服务端的调用流程是怎样的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-b524okm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-b524okm","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整个项目是一个单进程的 ASGI 服务，代码按四层划分。最上面是入口层，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"main.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 负责解析命令行、加载配置、组装应用并启动 Uvicorn。往下是工具层，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tools"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 目录里实现了文件上传、CDB 执行、会话管理三类 MCP 工具。再往下是 API 层，把同一套能力包装成 REST 接口和网页。最底下是核心层，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"core"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 目录里是真正干活的："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cdb_session"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 封装单个 CDB 子进程，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"session_manager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 管理会话池，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"file_manager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 管文件和符号，还有输出过滤、输出解析、preset、磁盘清理这些模块。层与层之间的依赖是单向的，上层依赖下层，下层不能反过来引用上层，只有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"main.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 可以依赖所有层。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-2b4efsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-2b4efsa","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一条完整的调用链是这样：AI 先调用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_upload"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 申请一个一次性上传地址，然后用 curl 把 dump 传上去，服务端算 SHA1 去重后存到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dumps"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 目录；接着调用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_create_session"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 启动一个常驻 CDB 进程并返回 session_id；之后反复调用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_session_exec"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在同一个进程里执行命令或 preset；最后 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_close_session"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 关掉进程释放资源。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-qsf60k2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-qsf60k2","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么选择 Python + Starlette + FastMCP + Uvicorn 这套技术栈？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-0fmx52h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-0fmx52h","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我主要看重\"一个进程覆盖三种入口\"这个点。Starlette 加 Uvicorn 是纯异步的 HTTP 方案，能让我在同一个 ASGI 应用里同时挂上 MCP、REST 和 Web，不用拆成多个服务。FastMCP 负责把 Python 函数注册成 AI 能发现的工具，Cursor、Claude 这些客户端开箱即用。aiohttp 用来异步下载外部 URL 的文件，PyYAML 读配置，CDB 本身就是 Windows 自带的命令行调试器。Python 版本要求 3.10 以上，主要是用到了 dataclass、类型注解和 asyncio 的改进。这个选型的核心逻辑是，这个项目是 IO 密集型的，瓶颈在子进程通信和文件读写，用 Python 开发快、生态好，性能上通过线程池桥接阻塞 IO 完全够用。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-br9n4dw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-br9n4dw","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么同时提供 MCP、REST、Web 三种入口？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-bwl3wub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-bwl3wub","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为这三类调用者的需求不一样。AI 客户端适合走 MCP，服务端暴露的工具参数结构化、可发现，AI 不用自己去拼 HTTP 请求。自动化脚本适合走 REST，普通 HTTP 加 JSON，任何语言都能调。人工排查适合走 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/cdb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 网页，浏览器里点几下就能上传 dump、执行命令。关键点是这三个入口不是三套独立实现，REST 和 Web 最终都转发到工具层，工具层再调核心层，这样避免了三套逻辑行为不一致的问题。如果只留 MCP，脚本和人工用起来会很别扭；只留 REST，AI 侧就要重复处理接口协议，所以这是调用体验和代码复用之间的折中。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-1hrz19n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-1hrz19n","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目解决了什么痛点？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-hwrmu39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-hwrmu39","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"传统方式下，开发者要在自己机器上装 WinDbg，手动打开 dump、敲命令、再把结果复制给别人或者 AI。这个项目把调试能力集中部署到一台 Windows 服务器上，客户端完全不用装 CDB，AI 通过 MCP 直接调用，脚本通过 REST 自动化，人工通过网页操作。而且大 dump 不经过 MCP 消息体，走独立的流式上传；同一个 CDB 会话还能连续执行多轮命令，适合深入排查。核心价值就是把 CDB 的能力服务化，再把不适合直接给 AI 的原始输出转换成更可靠、更省 token 的结构化结果。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-1ifrvl8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-1ifrvl8","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目不是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-ztnj2bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-ztnj2bk","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面试的时候我会主动说清楚边界。它不是一个完整的 WinDbg 图形界面，不是一个自动修复程序，也不是通用的 Windows 进程监控平台，更不是自己实现调试器协议的项目。它的核心工作就是\"把 CDB 的能力服务化\"，把原始文本输出转换成更适合 AI 使用的结构化结果。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-wqivoz9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-wqivoz9","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目是怎么部署的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-c28qwh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-c28qwh7","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单进程部署。一个 Uvicorn 进程里跑一个 Starlette ASGI 应用，应用下面挂了一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ThreadPoolExecutor"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 线程池和一个最多 15 个的 CDB 子进程池。线程池的工作线程数等于 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_sessions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这样 CDB 进程数量和执行 CDB 的线程数量能对上，避免出现一堆 CDB 进程却没线程调度的情况。会话默认空闲 30 分钟自动清理，上传大小默认限制 4GB，超出直接返回 413。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-wviwm7p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-wviwm7p","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么服务端只能部署在 Windows？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-4mvt1is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-4mvt1is","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为项目的核心能力完全依赖 CDB 调试器，而 CDB 是 Windows SDK Debugging Tools 的一部分，只能在 Windows 上运行。服务端通过 subprocess 启动 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cdb.exe"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 来打开和分析 dump，所以服务端必须跑在一台装了 CDB 的 Windows 机器上。Python 本身是跨平台的，但 CDB 这个底层依赖决定了部署平台，这是\"能力依赖决定部署环境\"的典型例子。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-hs2rzb8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-hs2rzb8","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目的配置是怎么管理的？优先级是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-5g6ebzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-5g6ebzx","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"配置用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ServerConfig"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这个 dataclass 集中管理，通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"load_config"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 加载。优先级从高到低是：命令行参数、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CDB_ANALYSIS_"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 前缀的环境变量、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"config.yaml"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 文件、最后是 dataclass 的默认值。环境变量会做类型转换，比如端口和超时转成 int，verbose 转成 bool。配置加载完就存到全局单例里，各模块通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"get_config"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 访问。这个设计的好处是，同一个配置既能本地开发写死、又能部署时用环境变量覆盖，敏感信息比如 auth_token 可以走环境变量而不是写死在文件里。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-e08ez6t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-e08ez6t","updated":"20260902171815"}},{"ID":"20260902171815-5xo4wzp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-5xo4wzp","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 2：MCP 协议与 AI 工具互联"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-lc782vd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-lc782vd","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP 是什么？为什么在这个项目里用 MCP？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-3jryas5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-3jryas5","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP 是 Model Context Protocol 的缩写，模型上下文协议，是 Anthropic 提出的一套让模型和外部工具之间标准化的协议。在这个项目里，它让 Cursor、Claude Desktop、CodeBuddy 这些 AI 客户端能自动发现并调用我们的调试工具。服务端用 FastMCP 把 Python 函数注册成工具，AI 客户端在 MCP 配置里填一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地址就能连上，不用理解我们内部的 HTTP 细节。相比直接走 REST，MCP 的好处是参数和返回值都结构化，AI 知道每个参数的类型和含义，工具列表也能自动加载。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-fhz427t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-fhz427t","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务端注册了哪些 MCP 工具？分别干什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-o6cxtnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-o6cxtnt","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一共 7 个工具，分成三类。文件类有三个："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_upload"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 申请 dump 或符号的上传地址，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_import_from_url"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 让服务端直接从 URL 下载文件，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_query"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是一个统一查询接口，能查 dump 列表、session 列表、符号缓存和服务信息。执行类有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_execute_cdb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，它是一次性执行，每次启动一个新进程，适合少量快速命令。会话类有三个："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_create_session"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 创建常驻会话并自动返回 dump 基础信息，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_session_exec"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在会话里批量执行命令或 preset，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_close_session"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 关会话释放资源。另外还注册了三个 prompt，按需加载，放 CDB 命令速查表和分析工作流这些内容。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-5803vb3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-5803vb3","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"工具是怎么注册的？为什么用 wrapper 模式？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-4cs2sji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-4cs2sji","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"main.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"build_app"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 里用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"@mcp.tool()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 装饰器注册工具，但装饰的函数只是个薄包装，函数体就一行，转发到对应 tools 模块里的真正实现。这样做的目的是把 MCP 注册和业务逻辑解耦，业务函数不依赖 FastMCP 框架，可以单独做单元测试，将来换 MCP 框架或者加 REST 入口，业务代码都不用动。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-c42v3q0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-c42v3q0","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么工具粒度要设计成 7 个而不是一个超级工具？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-zha31vy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-zha31vy","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我按\"生命周期加资源类型\"来切分的。文件一个维度，执行一个维度，会话生命周期一个维度。这样调用方可以按场景自由组合：上传、创建会话、反复执行、最后关闭。工具参数清晰，不会出现一个工具挂几十个参数的情况。而且 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"session_exec"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 支持一次传多条命令和多个 preset，能用一次调用做完一个批次的命令，减少 MCP 的 round-trip。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-9bp33k6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-9bp33k6","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么把上传拆成\"申请地址\"和\"上传\"两步？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-dl0yd3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-dl0yd3j","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 MCP 工具调用传的是结构化 JSON 参数，不适合直接承载几 GB 的二进制 dump。如果走 MCP 内嵌 base64，一个 1GB 的 dump 编码后会变成 1.4GB 左右的字符串，AI 上下文根本放不下。所以拆成两步：第一步 AI 调 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_upload"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拿到一个一次性上传地址，第二步客户端用 curl 或者普通 HTTP 把文件流式传上去。这样 MCP 的消息体保持很小，上传走普通 HTTP，兼容任何客户端。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-vlp7qid","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-vlp7qid","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么把一堆查询接口合并成一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_query"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-9knzjg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-9knzjg2","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为工具数量太多会消耗 AI 的上下文，每个工具的参数描述都会进 system prompt。所以我把 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"list_dumps"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"check_dump"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"list_sessions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"check_session"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"symbol_cache"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"server_info"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这些查询全部塞进一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_query"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，通过一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"command"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 参数分发。AI 可以先调 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"help"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 看有哪些子命令，需要时再调具体的。代价是每次调用要多带一个 command 参数，但相比上下文收益是划算的。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-5izsx3h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-5izsx3h","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么把命令参考放在 prompt 而不是 tool？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-kn428q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-kn428q1","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP 的 prompt 是按需加载的模板，不像 tool 那样常驻在上下文里。CDB 的命令速查表、分析工作流、分析建议这些内容平时用不到，如果做成 tool 的参数描述，会白白占用 AI 的 token。做成 prompt 之后，AI 只有在真正分析 dump 的时候才会按需拉取，这样既保留了能力，又不污染默认上下文。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-lmb6hlw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-lmb6hlw","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP Streamable HTTP 是什么？和普通 HTTP 有什么区别？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-4sxnv7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-4sxnv7x","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP 有两种传输方式，一种是老的 stdio，就是本地进程间通信，另一种是 Streamable HTTP，基于 HTTP 协议传输，支持流式响应。这个项目用的是 Streamable HTTP，因为服务是远程部署的，AI 客户端通过网络连接。它的端点就是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，AI 客户端 POST 过来，服务端返回工具列表或者工具执行结果，支持流式，适合长任务。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-htoy7r6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-htoy7r6","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三个 MCP prompt 分别是什么？为什么这样设计？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-4k4a9f1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-4k4a9f1","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三个 prompt 分别是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"analysis_workflow"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 分析工作流、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cdb_commands"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" CDB 命令速查表、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"analysis_tips"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 分析建议。设计动机是这些内容是\"知识型\"的，不是\"动作型\"的，不适合做成工具，做成 prompt 可以按需加载、不常驻上下文。AI 只有在真正分析 dump 的时候才会通过 prompts/get 拉取，平时不占 token。这本质上是把 CDB 命令参考从系统提示词里抽出来，做到\"用到才加载\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-1tjglqu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-1tjglqu","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"REST API 和 MCP 工具为什么复用同一套 tools？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-nay0r65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-nay0r65","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 CDB 的核心业务逻辑只有一套，上传、建会话、执行命令这些动作，REST 和 MCP 只是两种不同的外壳。如果 REST 自己再实现一遍，就会出现两套逻辑、行为不一致的问题，改一处逻辑还得改两个地方。所以 REST 层只做参数校验、HTTP 状态码转换，然后转发到 tools 层，tools 层再调 core 层。这样三个入口共用一套核心，改一次逻辑三个入口同时生效。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-9y7isfz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-9y7isfz","updated":"20260902171815"}},{"ID":"20260902171815-9yskpuv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-9yskpuv","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 3：CDB 子进程通信核心技术"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-6qbt36u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-6qbt36u","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB 是什么？项目是怎么和它通信的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-go4h5p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-go4h5p3","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB 是 Windows SDK Debugging Tools 自带的命令行调试器，本质上是 WinDbg 的命令行版本。启动命令大概是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cdb.exe -z crash.dmp -y 符号路径 -lines"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，其中 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-z"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 指定 dump 文件，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-y"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 指定符号搜索路径，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-lines"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 开启行号信息。CDB 启动后是一个交互式的 REPL，从 stdin 读命令，往 stdout 输出结果。项目通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"subprocess.Popen"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 启动它，把 stdin、stdout 设成管道，stderr 合并到 stdout，text 模式按行读，cwd 设成 cdb.exe 所在目录，Windows 下还加了 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"DETACHED_PROCESS"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 标志。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-8ejez21","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-8ejez21","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么不能每次命令都用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"subprocess.run()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 启动新进程？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-i1gbgo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-i1gbgo4","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为每条命令都重新启动进程的话，就要重新打开 dump、重新初始化调试器、重新加载符号，对大型 dump 来说这个启动开销可能比命令本身还大。而且这种方式无法保留调试上下文，比如当前线程、当前异常上下文、当前模块状态，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".lastevent"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".exr -1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这种有状态的连续操作就做不了。所以项目保留了两种模式："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_execute_cdb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是一次性执行，适合少量无状态命令；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"create_session"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 加 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"session_exec"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是持久会话，适合多轮深入分析。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-hwa8oa5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-hwa8oa5","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么判断一条 CDB 命令执行完了？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-hasadhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-hasadhy","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB 没有统一的\"命令结束\"标志，不同命令、不同状态下的 prompt 会变，符号加载和进度日志还会夹杂在输出里，所以不能靠正则匹配 prompt 来判断。项目用的办法是显式完成标记，每次执行命令后在后面发一句 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".echo COMMAND_COMPLETED_MARKER"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，后台读取线程一看到这行就知道命令结束了，然后 set 一个 ready_event 事件。主调用方通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ready_event.wait(timeout)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 等待结果。这个方案的好处是完成条件由服务端主动注入，不依赖 CDB prompt 的具体文本，对各种版本和状态都稳定。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-1gwoi8m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-1gwoi8m","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么防止上一条命令的输出串到下一条？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-dfjmunu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-dfjmunu","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"完成标记只能解决\"什么时候结束\"，解决不了\"哪些行属于哪条命令\"。所以项目又加了一层 UUID 边界标记。执行命令时生成一个 uuid，先发 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".echo ===CMD_BOUNDARY_\u0026lt;uuid\u0026gt;_START==="},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，再发真正的命令，然后发 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"===CMD_BOUNDARY_\u0026lt;uuid\u0026gt;_END==="},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，最后发完成标记。后台线程把所有行收进缓冲区，主调用方拿到后按这个 uuid 严格提取 START 和 END 之间的行，START 之前和 END 之后的都丢弃。为什么用 UUID 而不是固定字符串？因为连续请求如果都用固定 START/END，就分不清哪条边界属于哪次调用，UUID 让每次执行的边界都唯一。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-v5m7fvu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-v5m7fvu","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么需要后台读取线程？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-p2m5cf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-p2m5cf1","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB 的 stdout 是持续输出的流。如果不持续消费，就会出现死锁：主线程写完命令后等 marker，但 CDB 输出太多，stdout 管道缓冲区写满，CDB 阻塞等缓冲区腾空，主线程又等不到 marker，两边互相卡死。所以 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CDBSession"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在初始化的时候启动了一个 daemon 后台线程，这个线程不停地读 stdout，把每行放进列表，看到完成标记就 set ready_event。这样 stdout 始终在被消费，管道不会满。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-0fwjtzi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-0fwjtzi","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"终端控制字符 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\r"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\b"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为什么要处理？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-jrpw0kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-jrpw0kj","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB 的进度输出，比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Building memory map: 001000"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，在真实控制台里是用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\r"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 回到行首覆盖显示，用户最终只看到最后一行。但是管道模式下 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\r"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 会原样保留在文本里，变成一大串 \"Building memory map: 001000\\rBuilding memory map: 002000\\r...\" 这样的重复文本。如果直接返回给 AI，既浪费 token 又没意义。所以项目在读取线程里逐字符模拟终端行为："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\r"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 让光标回到行首、后续字符覆盖前面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\b"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 让光标左移一位。处理完之后只保留最终可见的那一行。这是一个很好的工程细节，在数据源头恢复终端最终效果，比下游每个解析器各自处理更合理。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-rgynhif","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-rgynhif","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"命令超时了怎么处理？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-5fw98vs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-5fw98vs","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"send_command_isolated"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ready_event.wait(timeout)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 等结果。如果超时但已经看到了 START 边界，就把边界内已经捕获到的内容返回，同时标记 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"boundary_status=\"timeout\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为长命令比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 可能已经产生了一部分有价值的诊断信息，应该尽量保留。如果连 START 边界都没建立，就抛 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CDBError"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，上层返回错误。调用方通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"output_boundary"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 字段判断结果是否完整。这套逻辑的核心思想是，超时了先保留已有输出，再判断 session 还能不能继续用，而不是直接丢掉结果。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-9020s1o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-9020s1o","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关闭 CDB 进程为什么要先发 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"q"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 再 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"terminate"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-z7qie8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-z7qie8n","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 CDB 是有状态的进程，直接强杀可能会让 symstore 索引或者符号缓存写不完整。所以关闭的时候先往 stdin 写一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"q"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 命令让它优雅退出，flush 一下符号缓存，然后等几秒，如果还没退出再 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"terminate"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 强制结束。这是个优雅关闭的细节。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-pswnzs7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-pswnzs7","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双模式执行分别适合什么场景？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-x2as3ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-x2as3ls","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"One-shot 模式就是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_execute_cdb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，每次启动新进程，执行完就关，适合快速、独立、无状态的少量命令，代价是大 dump 会比较慢。交互式模式就是 create_session 加 session_exec，进程常驻，适合多轮深入分析，能保留调试上下文，还能做符号预加载。面试时我会强调，这是为了在\"启动开销\"和\"资源占用\"之间做权衡，让调用方自己选。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-f3xl2l7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-f3xl2l7","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB 启动后怎么确认它已经 ready 可以接收命令了？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-br1w4x6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-br1w4x6","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CDBSession"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在构造函数里启动 CDB 之后，会先往 stdin 发一个完成 marker，然后同步等待后台读取线程看到这个 marker 并 set ready_event。这一步是构造时就阻塞等待的，如果超时了就直接 shutdown 进程并抛 CDBError。这样能保证构造函数返回的时候，CDB 一定已经完成初始化、可以接收命令了，而不是\"进程起来了但内部还没就绪\"，避免后面第一条命令发进去石沉大海。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-o5l76al","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-o5l76al","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"_find_cdb_executable"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是怎么定位 cdb.exe 的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-ugwf17b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-ugwf17b","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它先检查配置里有没有显式指定 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cdb_path"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有就直接用。没有的话，就按一组预设的默认路径去找，比如 Windows Kits 10 Debuggers 的 x64 和 x86 目录，还有老版 Debugging Tools for Windows 的目录，哪个文件存在就用哪个。如果都找不到，就抛 CDBError，提示用户在配置里指定路径。这是\"配置优先、默认路径兜底\"的查找策略。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-q9oblm7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-q9oblm7","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么 stderr 要合并到 stdout？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-haz21f9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-haz21f9","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 CDB 的诊断信息、符号加载日志、警告这些内容，有一部分是输出到 stderr 的。如果分开读，就要同时管理两个管道、两个读取线程，复杂度翻倍，而且 CDB 的错误提示和正常输出经常交错出现，分开读反而会丢失时序关系。合并成一个流之后，用一个后台线程按顺序读，输出顺序就是 CDB 实际产生的顺序，对边界检测和解析都更简单可靠。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-rfsviv4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-rfsviv4","updated":"20260902171815"}},{"ID":"20260902171815-c7lkhfq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-c7lkhfq","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 4：网络与并发"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-zb5odc7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-zb5odc7","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异步服务里为什么还需要线程池？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-9pvlorm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-9pvlorm","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目的 HTTP 层是异步的，但 CDB 的交互本质是阻塞式 IO：往 stdin 写命令、等 stdout 出现标记，还有文件读写、symstore、目录清理，这些全是阻塞操作。如果在 async 函数里直接调这些阻塞代码，整个事件循环就会被卡住，其他请求都得不到响应，一个长时间的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 就能拖垮整个服务。所以项目在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SessionManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 里建了一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ThreadPoolExecutor"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"loop.run_in_executor"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 把阻塞的 CDB 调用交给工作线程执行，事件循环只负责收请求和等结果。这样阻塞操作不占事件循环，多个会话还能并发跑。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-bpazqsj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-bpazqsj","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_sessions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 同时限制了哪些东西？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-qiar6wz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-qiar6wz","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_sessions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 默认 15，它同时限制两样东西：一是 CDB 子进程的数量，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"_sessions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 字典最多存 15 个会话；二是线程池的工作线程数，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=15)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个设计很巧妙，一个数字同时约束两个资源，让 CDB 进程数和执行 CDB 的线程数大致匹配，避免出现创建了大量 CDB 进程但线程池调度不过来的情况。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-s065dcy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-s065dcy","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会话的生命周期是怎么管理的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-qsbcm8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-qsbcm8l","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建会话时，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"create_session"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 先检查池子满没满，满了抛 RuntimeError，没满就生成一个 UUID 作为 session_id，启动 CDB 进程，然后用一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SessionInfo"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 对象记录 session_id、dump_sha1、创建时间、最近活动时间、命令计数、符号状态这些业务元数据。执行命令时更新 last_activity 和命令计数。关闭时先 shutdown CDB 进程，再从字典移除。后台还有一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cleanup_idle_sessions"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 任务，每 60 秒扫一遍，把空闲超过 30 分钟的会话自动关掉。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-7djbja6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-7djbja6","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SessionInfo"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 要单独存在？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-6yj5qkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-6yj5qkl","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CDBSession"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 只关心\"怎么操作一个 CDB 进程\"，它是进程层的封装。而 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SessionInfo"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 记录的是业务层的状态，比如 session_id、dump_sha1、最近活动时间、执行了多少条命令、符号加载到哪一步了。把进程控制和业务元数据分开，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SessionManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 就能聚合查看所有会话，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CDBSession"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 专注进程 IO，职责更清晰。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-dmgxte9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-dmgxte9","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette、Uvicorn、FastMCP 三者的关系是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-ut38x78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-ut38x78","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它们是三个不同层次，不是互相竞争的服务器。Uvicorn 在最底层，负责监听 TCP 端口、接收 HTTP 请求，把请求转成 ASGI 的 scope、receive、send 传给应用。Starlette 在中间，是 ASGI 框架，负责路由、中间件、Request 和 Response 的抽象。FastMCP 在业务层，负责把 Python 函数注册成 MCP 工具和 prompt，提供 Streamable HTTP 传输。数据流就是 Uvicorn 收到请求交给 Starlette 分发，Starlette 根据路径交给 FastMCP 或者 REST、Web 的 handler。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-t4lez4b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-t4lez4b","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 路由为什么要从 streamable_http_app 里拆出来 splice？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-t7vd2qd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-t7vd2qd","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是个很隐蔽的坑。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mcp.streamable_http_app()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 默认返回的应用会把 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用 Mount 挂载，而 Starlette 对 Mount 会处理尾斜杠重定向，导致部分 MCP 客户端发 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"POST /mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 不带尾斜杠的时候，被服务端 307 重定向到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp/"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有些 MCP 客户端实现不跟随重定向，就连接失败了。所以项目在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"build_app"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 里直接把 streamable_http_app 的路由提取出来，追加到父 Starlette 的路由表里，这样 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 就是一个普通 Route 而不是 Mount，不会触发 307。这个细节能体现对框架默认行为的理解。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-hzre86j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-hzre86j","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DNS rebinding 保护是怎么回事？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-uyzg31q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-uyzg31q","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DNS rebinding 攻击是攻击者控制域名解析，让它一会解析到公网、一会解析到内网 IP，从而绕过同源策略访问内网服务。项目在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"build_app"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 里根据 host 配置动态处理：绑 0.0.0.0 的时候关闭保护，因为这时候无法枚举所有合法的 Host 头；绑具体 IP 的时候开启保护，allowlist 只包含配置的 host 和 localhost 系列。面试时可以说，这是根据部署方式动态决定是否启用 Host 校验。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-795z3ro","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-795z3ro","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同一个 session 并发安全问题要注意什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-e78xdtb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-e78xdtb","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是项目的已知边界。同一个 CDB session 本质上只有一组 stdin/stdout 管道，如果两个请求同时往里面写命令，命令顺序会被打乱，输出会交叉污染。当前实现里，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CDBSession"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 有一个线程锁保护输出缓冲区，但这不等于命令级的互斥。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ThreadPoolExecutor"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 只保证阻塞调用不占事件循环，不保证同一 session 的命令串行。所以如果未来允许同一个 session 并行执行多个请求，需要给每个 session 加命令级锁，把\"写命令、等结果、取输出\"作为一个完整的临界区保护起来。我会主动说清楚这个边界和改法。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-g9xk89m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-g9xk89m","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"lifespan 启动和关闭的时候做了什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-zzrktti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-zzrktti","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette 的 lifespan 是应用生命周期的钩子。启动的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"main.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 会启动 SessionManager 的空闲会话清理后台任务，还有 DiskCleaner 的定时清理任务。关闭的时候，会调用 SessionManager 的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"shutdown_all"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 关掉所有 CDB 会话，flush 一下元数据，停掉清理任务。这样能保证服务退出时资源都被正确释放，不会留下孤儿 CDB 进程或者写了一半的元数据文件。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-v2qxsz2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-v2qxsz2","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CORS 是怎么配置的？为什么这么配？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-kuo03np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-kuo03np","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CORS 允许所有来源，同时暴露了 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Mcp-Session-Id"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 头。原因是这是一个内网工具服务，部署在公司内部网络里，调用方来源不固定，没必要做严格限制。暴露 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Mcp-Session-Id"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是因为 MCP Streamable HTTP 需要这个响应头来做会话管理，浏览器跨域调用时如果没有暴露这个头，前端就拿不到。如果未来要公网部署，这个宽松的 CORS 策略需要收紧。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-hvman8e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-hvman8e","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么线程池的 max_workers 等于 max_sessions 而不是更大的值？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-x31oiwt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-x31oiwt","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为线程池主要是用来执行阻塞的 CDB 调用的，而 CDB 调用天然受 session 数量限制。最多同时有 max_sessions 个 CDB 进程，也就最多同时有这么多条命令在等结果，所以工作线程数等于 session 上限刚好够用。如果开更多线程，多出来的线程大部分时候也是闲着，还白白占用资源。这是一个\"按真实并发度来定线程池大小\"的做法，避免拍脑袋定一个很大的线程数。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-p8t3mfc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-p8t3mfc","updated":"20260902171815"}},{"ID":"20260902171815-nbw1mtx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-nbw1mtx","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 5：文件存储与数据管理"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-6rcn1qu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-6rcn1qu","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么用 SHA1 做文件指纹？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-urp7719","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-urp7719","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在这个项目里 SHA1 只是文件内容指纹，不是密码也不是鉴权。160 位的长度足够做内容寻址，计算速度快，GB 级的文件用 8MB 分块算也不会卡，而且不需要加密强度。它带来三个直接好处：一是去重，同一个 dump 再传一次就直接复用旧文件；二是稳定定位，后面创建会话的时候用 sha1 就能找到文件；三是元数据关联，session、用户符号目录、访问记录都围绕 sha1 组织。要注意的是 SHA1 有理论碰撞风险，所以不能拿来做鉴权，鉴权靠 Bearer Token 和一次性上传 token。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-ijl8szm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-ijl8szm","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大文件为什么一定要分块读写？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-9dkoz53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-9dkoz53","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 dump 可能到 GB 级别。如果一次性把整个文件读进内存，内存峰值会随文件大小线性增长，多个并发上传还会放大内存压力，严重的会触发 OOM。所以上传接口用 8MB 一块的方式流式消费请求体，算 SHA1 也是 8MB 一块循环读，内存占用始终和单块大小有关，和文件总大小无关。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-p4gkqs7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-p4gkqs7","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"元数据为什么不用数据库？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-d9m1o0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-d9m1o0l","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为当前元数据很简单，就是 dump 的上传时间、最近访问时间、访问次数、文件大小，用途就是查询、过期判断、LRU 淘汰，没有复杂关联查询和事务。所以 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MetadataStore"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用 JSON 文件就够了，部署简单，单进程下规模也轻，JSON 还方便人工查看和故障恢复。但项目也没完全忽略可靠性：内存用线程锁保护，写盘用延迟刷盘，写文件先写 tmp 再原子替换，启动时还会和文件系统对齐一次。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-v06ky9j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-v06ky9j","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么访问记录不能每次都写磁盘？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-yz9l9d8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-yz9l9d8","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"record_access"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 会被频繁调用，session_exec 每执行一次命令都要更新访问时间。如果每次都完整写 JSON，每次访问都触发磁盘 IO，多线程还要频繁抢锁，写放大很严重。所以项目采用延迟刷盘：内存里的访问时间立即更新，累计 10 次变更或者距离上次刷盘超过 60 秒才写一次盘。写的时候先写 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"metadata.json.tmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，再用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"os.replace"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 原子替换，这样进程中断也不会留下半个 JSON。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-euifm27","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-euifm27","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"symstore 索引为什么要串行化？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-15o1t68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-15o1t68","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"FileManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 里有一个类级别的锁，所有 symstore.exe 调用都要先拿这个锁。原因是多个会话或者多个上传同时更新同一个符号缓存目录的时候，可能互相覆盖索引、导致缓存目录状态不一致，两个 symstore 进程同时写同一个位置还可能冲突。这个锁牺牲了一定的并行度，但保护了共享符号缓存的一致性，是个值得讲的权衡。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-avgwg0u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-avgwg0u","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pdb_cache"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为什么不参与清理？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-90nc5qd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-90nc5qd","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pdb_cache"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是 symstore 索引出来的微软公共符号缓存，可以被多个 dump 共享。如果按 dump 的 sha1 去清理，就会破坏这种共享性，导致后面的 dump 又要重新下载符号。所以清理策略是：dumps 目录做 LRU 淘汰加超龄清理，user_pdbs 跟着关联 dump 级联删除，tmp 目录清理超时残留，唯独 pdb_cache 不碰。这个设计体现的是\"共享资源不能按单个业务对象粒度清理\"的原则。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-cqhsaow","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-cqhsaow","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清理任务怎么避免误删正在使用的 dump？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-pvzxtyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-pvzxtyv","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分两类保护。对临时目录，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cleanup_tmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 会先拿当前活跃的上传 token 集合，如果目录还对应着一个活跃 token，就认为上传可能还在进行，直接跳过，只有目录 mtime 超过阈值且不活跃才删。对正式 dump，清理的时候会先拿活跃 session 正在使用的 sha1 集合，如果某个 dump 正在被 session 用，就记一个 skipped_in_use 计数，跳过不删。删除的时候走级联删除，同时处理 dump 文件、关联的用户 PDB 和元数据，避免留下孤立记录。另外还有最少保留数量保护，即使所有 dump 都过期，也至少保留最近几个。核心思想是清理任务不能只看文件多久没改，必须结合运行时状态和业务引用关系。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-6dwzivh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-6dwzivh","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"sync_with_filesystem"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是干什么的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-vq9dh1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-vq9dh1w","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务启动的时候，磁盘上可能存在历史遗留的 dump 没有元数据记录，或者元数据里有的 dump 文件已经被删了。这个函数就是启动时做一次对齐：给磁盘上存在但缺元数据的 dump 补记录，用文件的 mtime 当上传时间；删掉指向不存在文件的孤立元数据；给老 dump 一个合理的访问时间，避免服务刚启动它们就被判过期清掉。这体现的是启动时的健壮性。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-zlf8khh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-zlf8khh","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据目录结构是怎么设计的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-lj6wbwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-lj6wbwv","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"data_dir"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 下面分了四个子目录，职责很清晰。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dumps"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 存 dump 文件，按 sha1 命名；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"user_pdbs"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 存用户上传的私有符号，按 dump 的 sha1 分子目录，这样每个 dump 的私有符号互相隔离；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pdb_cache"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 存 symstore 索引结果和微软公共符号缓存，是共享的；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 存上传过程中的临时文件，按 token 分子目录。这样设计的好处是，清理的时候可以按目录粒度做不同的策略，比如 dumps 做 LRU 淘汰、tmp 做超时清理、pdb_cache 完全不碰。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-ijzd78m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-ijzd78m","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"符号路径 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"get_symbols_path"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是怎么构建的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-s1w91bg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-s1w91bg","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它把配置里的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"symbols_path"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 作为基础，先替换掉 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"{data_dir}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"{pdb_cache}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 两个占位符，然后如果传了 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump_sha1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就把这个 dump 对应的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"user_pdbs"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 目录插到路径最前面，最后用分号连接成完整的符号搜索路径。这样 CDB 加载符号时会先找用户上传的私有符号，再找公共符号缓存和微软符号服务器，保证私有符号优先命中。这个优先级顺序很关键，否则用户上传的私有 PDB 会被公共符号盖掉。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-89mg6b8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-89mg6b8","updated":"20260902171815"}},{"ID":"20260902171815-g627vkd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-g627vkd","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 6：大文件上传与流式处理"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-5zc5cig","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-5zc5cig","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么上传要设计成两步？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-j30xzur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-j30xzur","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 MCP 工具调用传的是结构化 JSON，不适合直接承载 GB 级的二进制内容。两步上传把\"控制面\"和\"数据面\"分开了：第一步申请地址，返回一个可以 curl 的 URL；第二步客户端用普通 HTTP 流式上传。这样 MCP 消息体保持小，curl 友好，服务端能按块流式写盘，token 一次性使用还能限制上传地址的滥用窗口。URL 导入也走相同的 finalize 逻辑，复用同一套后处理。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-dcigtdx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-dcigtdx","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"流式上传怎么避免内存爆炸？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-frt676m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-frt676m","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不把整个 dump 读成一个 bytes 对象。上传接口用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"request.stream()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 或者 multipart 的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"read(chunk)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 每次读 8MB，读一块写一块，同时累计大小，超过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_upload_size"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 就删掉临时文件返回 413。这样内存占用只和单块大小有关，和文件总大小无关，多个并发上传也是这个上限。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-yestv0s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-yestv0s","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SHA1 计算为什么要分块？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-rxq1h2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-rxq1h2z","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 dump 可能 GB 级，如果一次性读进内存算 SHA1，内存峰值就是文件大小，多个并发上传会放大内存压力。所以 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"compute_sha1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"hashlib.sha1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 加 8MB 循环读文件，逐块 update，最后 hexdigest。上传的时候已经是流式写盘了，算 SHA1 再分块读就不会额外放大内存。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-4qa3p8y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-4qa3p8y","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"URL 导入是怎么工作的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-b9ympe6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-b9ympe6","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_import_from_url"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 让服务端用 aiohttp 从外部 URL 流式下载 dump 或者符号文件，下载完复用 finalize 的逻辑。符号文件在 finalize 的时候会同步执行 symstore 索引，保证调用方拿到的就是已经索引完成的状态，这和普通符号上传的后台异步索引路径不一样，面试时我会说明这个差别。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-d6grdsx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-d6grdsx","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一次性上传 token 怎么保证安全？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-v93v5xx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-v93v5xx","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"token 是 UUID 随机生成的一次性凭证，创建的时候在内存里登记，finalize 完成后立刻删掉，再次访问就 404。这样即使 token 泄漏，也只能用一次，攻击窗口很小。但要注意 token 不是鉴权，它只是限制上传地址的使用范围，真正的鉴权靠 Bearer Token。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-7ubsu69","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-7ubsu69","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上传支持哪两种方式？它们有什么区别？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-q7idqcu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-q7idqcu","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"支持 PUT raw body 和 POST multipart/form-data 两种。PUT 直接把文件内容作为请求体，适合大文件，文件名从 query 参数里取；POST 是标准表单上传，从 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"file"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 字段取文件内容。两种方式最终都走同一套流式写盘和 finalize 逻辑。设计上 PUT 是推荐方式，POST 是为了兼容浏览器和一部分习惯用表单的客户端。上传接口还会根据 Content-Type 自动判断用哪种方式解析。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-kj1hmqz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-kj1hmqz","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上传大小超限是怎么处理的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-3p4hk37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-3p4hk37","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上传的时候每读一块就累加总大小，一旦超过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_upload_size"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（默认 4GB），立刻停止写入、删掉已经落盘的临时文件、返回 413。这样做的好处是\"尽早失败\"，不会等整个文件都传完才发现超限，既省了客户端的等待时间，也避免在磁盘上留下一个传了一半的大文件。而且是在写盘过程中实时判断的，不是传完才检查。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-9gqsplo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-9gqsplo","updated":"20260902171815"}},{"ID":"20260902171815-s1kkjbk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-s1kkjbk","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 7：在开发过程中遇到的棘手问题"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-b3yc976","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-b3yc976","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你们遇到过 CDB 命令输出串台的问题吗？怎么解决的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-uf0bpf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-uf0bpf2","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遇到过。最早项目用固定的 START/END 字符串加完成标记来切分命令输出，但 CDB 在批量命令模式下会输出一些异步的 warning，比如线程切换、模块加载提示，这些内容会横跨两条命令，导致前一条命令的输出片段被算进当前命令里，AI 拿到的解析结果就乱了。我定位的过程是，先在 session 里连发几条命令复现边界错位，然后看 CDB 的原始输出，发现是异步 warning 横跨了边界，根本原因是固定字符串分不清哪条边界属于哪次调用。最后改成每次执行生成一个 UUID 作为边界标记，严格按 UUID 提取边界内的行，UUID 的唯一性就消除了串扰。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-lvunk21","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-lvunk21","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遇到过 CDB 进程 stdout 死锁的问题吗？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-2tvi411","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-2tvi411","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遇到过。最早实现是写完命令后直接同步 readline 等结果，但 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这类命令输出可能好几 MB，Windows 的 stdout 管道缓冲区默认才 4KB 左右，很快就写满了。CDB 阻塞等缓冲区腾空，主线程又阻塞在 readline 上等不到结果，两边就死锁了。定位的时候看进程 CPU 还在跑，说明 CDB 没卡死，是通信层面卡住了。最后改成启动一个后台 daemon 线程持续消费 stdout，主调用方只看完成事件，这样管道始终在被读，就不会满。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-vjzi5fs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-vjzi5fs","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进度行里的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\r"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 污染输出是怎么处理的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-kjsc23v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-kjsc23v","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"执行 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!address -summary"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这类命令的时候，AI 会拿到几百行 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Building memory map: XXXX"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 重复文本。原因是这些进度在真实控制台用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\r"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 回行首覆盖，用户只看到最后一行，但管道模式下 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\r"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 原样保留了。我在读取线程里逐字符模拟终端，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\r"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清空当前行重写，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\\b"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 删一格，处理完只保留最终可见内容。在数据源头就处理掉，比下游每个解析器各自处理要干净得多。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-s4z07yq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-s4z07yq","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遇到过 MCP 客户端连不上的问题吗？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-ygz4uca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-ygz4uca","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遇到过。现象是 Cursor 和 Claude Desktop 这些客户端连不上 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，但用 curl 直接 POST 又是通的。查日志发现客户端实际访问的是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp/"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多了个尾斜杠，被服务端 307 重定向了，而部分 MCP 实现不跟随重定向。根因是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"mcp.streamable_http_app()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 默认用 Mount 挂载，Starlette 对 Mount 会做尾斜杠重定向。最后在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"build_app"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 里把 FastMCP 的路由直接 splice 进 Starlette 路由表，让 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 变成普通 Route，就绕开了 307。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-1gbj7n4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-1gbj7n4","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多实例部署的时候 session 不可见是怎么处理的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-q3m4aeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-q3m4aeb","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当前项目里 session 是存在单进程内存字典里的，如果部署两个实例，A 实例创建的 session，B 实例收到执行请求就找不到。这是个有意为之的边界，我在文档里明确写了建议单实例部署。改进方向是粘性路由，让同一个 session_id 始终路由到同一个 worker，或者做集中式的 session 服务，把 session 状态独立出来存储。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-zklxzbh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-zklxzbh","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"record_access"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 高频调用导致的 IO 放大是怎么解决的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-bo8sgm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-bo8sgm8","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"session_exec 每执行一次命令都要更新访问时间，如果每次都写 JSON，IO 会很重。我采用延迟刷盘的策略，内存立即更新，累计 10 次变更或者超过 60 秒才写一次盘，服务关闭的时候再 flush 一次。这样既保证了业务正确性，又把磁盘 IO 频率降下来了。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-q5qfmi8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-q5qfmi8","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴权中间件和流式上传冲突是怎么处理的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-gl8vgp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-gl8vgp8","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最早我用 Starlette 的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"BaseHTTPMiddleware"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 做 Bearer Token 鉴权，但发现上传大文件的时候内存会暴涨。原因是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"BaseHTTPMiddleware"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 默认会缓冲请求体，几 GB 的 dump 全读进内存才转发给 handler。最后改成纯 ASGI 中间件，直接操作 scope、receive、send，不缓冲 body，对流式上传和 MCP 的 streaming 都没有副作用。这是一个对中间件实现细节比较敏感的点。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-aw551tx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-aw551tx","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"metadata.json 写一半进程崩了怎么办？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-dtqzlt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-dtqzlt9","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最早 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"_save"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是直接 open 写文件，服务被 kill 的时候可能留下半个 JSON，下次启动就解析报错。后来改成先写 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"metadata.json.tmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，再用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"os.replace"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 原子替换，进程中断最坏情况就是 tmp 残留，正式文件保持上一次的完整状态。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-40fl509","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-40fl509","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上传 token 泄漏给未授权用户是怎么处理的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-3gnd3mx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-3gnd3mx","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最早鉴权的时候 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/uploads/{token}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 也强制要求 Bearer Token，但 AI 返回的 curl 命令往往不带 Authorization 头，导致上传失败。我意识到 upload token 本身就是独立凭证，应该是 UUID 随机、一次性使用，和 Bearer Token 是两个层面的东西。所以让鉴权中间件识别上传路径直接放行，Bearer Token 只保护 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/api/*"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/cdb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/status"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这些业务接口。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-flbcbw6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-flbcbw6","updated":"20260902171815"}},{"ID":"20260902171815-zyu7f32","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-zyu7f32","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 8：性能优化与问题排查"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-1k30cya","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-1k30cya","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB 输出为什么要做噪声过滤和截断？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-hi5cren","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-hi5cren","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 CDB 的原始输出是给人看的控制台文本，里面有 prompt 前缀、checksum 警告、DBGHELP 和 SYMSRV 的符号加载日志、空行、超长调用栈这些内容。直接返回给 AI 会浪费 token，关键诊断信息被噪声淹没，HTTP 响应体也变大。所以 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"filter_output"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 按固定顺序处理：先去 CDB prompt，再去已知噪声，最后按最大行数截断。先 prompt 再去噪声是因为有些噪声行可能带 prompt 前缀，顺序反了就过滤不到。调用方还能通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"strip_noise"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_output_lines"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 参数控制。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-hvspgb9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-hvspgb9","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"preset 是什么？设计它的意义是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-u5i06va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-u5i06va","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"preset 是把一组 CDB 命令和对应的解析器打包成一个可复用的分析组合。比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"quick_triage"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 就是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".lastevent"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".exr -1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!teb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这组命令，执行完解析成异常、调用栈、TEB 这些结构化字段。还有 exception_info、thread_summary、module_list、heap_overview、handle_summary、process_info、memory_summary 这些。它的价值不是减少 CDB 能力，而是把高频分析流程标准化，AI 不用每次自己拼命令，返回结果是结构化 JSON，多个客户端得到的初步分析字段也一致。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-3xet44h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-3xet44h","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解析器怎么兼容不同的 CDB 版本和输出格式？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-wan4her","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-wan4her","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"核心原则是解析失败返回 None，不抛异常，不阻塞 session 创建。每个解析函数独立，互不依赖，用正则容忍 CDB 输出格式的细微差异，比如 x86 和 x64 的反引号地址、16 位地址、帧号前缀这些。这样即使 CDB 版本或者输出格式变了，session 照样能创建，只是个别字段为空，比严格匹配失败就崩溃要鲁棒得多。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-syl53ny","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-syl53ny","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么排查 CDB 命令超时？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-3iyc9yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-3iyc9yf","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先要区分是命令本身耗时还是 CDB 失去响应。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 可能因为 dump 大、符号下载慢、堆分析复杂而超过默认超时，所以不能一超时就判 dump 坏了。排查流程是，先给这次命令传更长的 timeout，然后看 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"send_command_isolated"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的返回：如果超时但有 START 边界，就返回边界内已捕获的内容，标记 timeout；如果没有边界，就抛 CDBError。再用 check_session 看 CDB 是否还活着，决定继续等还是换轻命令还是关会话。核心是先保留已有输出，再判断 session 是否可用。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-gfihxjh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-gfihxjh","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么排查符号加载失败？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-6xe2ea6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-6xe2ea6","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"符号加载失败通常不是 CDB 没启动，而是 CDB 找不到和 dump 里模块完全匹配的符号。排查顺序是，先看现象，kb 或者模块输出里是不是出现地址、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\u0026lt;no module\u0026gt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、缺函数名；再看配置，symbols_path 里有没有包含本地缓存、用户符号目录和公共符号源；再看本地文件，上传的 pdb、dll、exe 是不是落到了对应 dump 的 user_pdbs 目录；然后看匹配关系，PDB 必须和模块的构建版本、GUID 匹配，文件名相同不代表符号对；最后主动执行 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".reload /f"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 强制重载，必要时 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!sym noisy"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 看细节。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-14pytu9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-14pytu9","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目最大的风险是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-flxfe82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-flxfe82","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我按影响面分三类。第一类是安全风险，固定 auth_token 写在配置文件里、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_import_from_url"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 可能被 SSRF 利用访问内网，改进是把密钥放环境变量、生产用 HTTPS、对 URL 做协议和 IP 段校验。第二类是状态和并发风险，session 存在单进程内存里，多实例不可见，同一 session 也没有完整的命令级锁，改进是粘性路由和每 session 命令锁。第三类是兼容性风险，解析器依赖正则和文本格式，CDB 版本变化可能导致字段解析失败，改进是加多版本测试样例、保留原始输出、记录字段级解析失败原因。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-kilqkw0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-kilqkw0","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面试中怎么评价项目的测试？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-84shmso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-84shmso","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我会说测试重点覆盖了不依赖真实 CDB 的部分，包括文件管理、SHA1、会话生命周期、输出过滤、输出解析、preset、元数据持久化、磁盘清理、上传接口、鉴权这些。CDB 本身通过 mock 隔离，这样测试稳定、执行快，但真实 CDB 的兼容性还需要在 Windows 集成环境里用样例 dump 做补充验证。这个说法比\"测试覆盖率很高\"更准确，因为当前环境确实没法证明真实 CDB 全链路可用。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-d7s7fx4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-d7s7fx4","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"符号预加载 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"prefetch_symbols"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是怎么工作的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-xs34d8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-xs34d8b","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建会话的时候如果把 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"prefetch_symbols"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 设成 true，会在后台线程里执行 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".reload /f"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 强制重新加载符号，同时把 session 的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"symbol_status"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 从 unknown 更新成 loading，加载完再更新成 ready 或者 error。这样调用方可以先创建会话、让符号在后台慢慢加载，等状态变成 ready 之后再执行命令，避免执行命令的时候才发现符号没加载好。这个设计把\"慢的符号加载\"和\"快的命令执行\"解耦开了。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-noq1b1g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-noq1b1g","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"output_filter"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为什么先去 prompt 再去噪声？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-6fh5jbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-6fh5jbj","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为有些噪声行前面可能带着 CDB 的 prompt 前缀，比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0:000\u0026gt; *** WARNING: ..."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果先去噪声，这些带前缀的噪声行就匹配不到、过滤不掉；先去 prompt 把前缀剥掉，再去噪声就能正确命中。这是一个处理顺序的细节，顺序反了会导致过滤不干净。项目里 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"filter_output"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 就是严格按\"去 prompt、去噪声、截断\"这个顺序执行的。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-bowo65c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-bowo65c","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目的可观测性是怎么做的？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-cx0s4r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-cx0s4r8","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"GET /status"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"GET /api/status"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 暴露服务状态，包括活跃会话数、最大会话数、dump 数量这些。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_query"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"server_info"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 子命令还能返回更详细的服务信息。另外清理任务、符号加载这些后台动作都有日志记录，比如 DiskCleaner 会记录删了多少文件、释放了多少空间、跳过了多少个正在使用的 dump。面试时我会说，可观测性目前偏基础，主要靠状态接口加日志，还没有指标采集和告警，这是可以加强的点。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-724t2w4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-724t2w4","updated":"20260902171815"}},{"ID":"20260902171815-eigdwgy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-eigdwgy","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 9：总结与项目复盘"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-6wmi518","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-6wmi518","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用一句话介绍这个项目？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-8v02sqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-8v02sqo","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我的项目是一个基于 Python、Starlette 和 FastMCP 的远程 Windows Crash Dump 分析服务，把 CDB 调试器能力包装成 MCP、REST、Web 三种入口，让 AI、脚本、人工用户都能远程分析 dump。核心链路是流式上传、SHA1 去重、创建会话、marker 和 UUID 边界执行命令、输出过滤和解析、最后输出结构化结果。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-pr380dr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-pr380dr","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目最有价值的地方是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-tb7cmp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-tb7cmp8","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最有价值的地方是把传统需要本机装 WinDbg 的调试流程服务化和 AI 化了。它让调试能力可以集中部署、跨客户端复用，AI 能通过 MCP 直接调工具，脚本能通过 REST 自动化，人工能通过网页操作，而且把不适合直接给 AI 的原始 CDB 文本转换成结构化结果，降低了 AI 分析的门槛。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-f12w3z7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-f12w3z7","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最值得讲的技术难点是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-t34849p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-t34849p","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最值得讲的是 CDB 子进程的 marker 加 UUID 双层边界机制。它解决了交互式调试输出截断和串扰两个问题，marker 负责结束检测，UUID 负责内容切片。配合后台读取线程解决 stdout 死锁，配合 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"apply_terminal_cr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 模拟终端控制字符，这套机制是整个项目可靠性的关键。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-y9ep58i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-y9ep58i","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过这个项目最大的收获是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-0nyn7g9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-0nyn7g9","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最大的收获是理解了几个工程原则。一个是清理任务不能只看文件多久没改，必须结合运行时状态和业务引用关系，所以 DiskCleaner 要拿活跃 session 的 sha1 集合做保护。一个是阻塞 IO 和异步框架的边界要清晰，该用线程池桥接的不能直接写进 async 函数。还有一个是边界检测不能依赖不可控的外部条件，比如 CDB prompt 的文本，要用自己注入的 marker 来控制。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-kmgsyvk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-kmgsyvk","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果重新设计，会重点改什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-p2xnjcu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-p2xnjcu","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我会重点解决三件事。第一是把 session 状态从单进程内存抽离出来，支持多实例部署，用粘性路由或者集中式 session 服务。第二是给同一个 session 加命令级的串行锁，把写命令、等结果、取输出作为一个临界区保护。第三是补真实 CDB 的集成测试，用固定的小型样例 dump 验证 CDB 启动、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".lastevent"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".effmach"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的输出，以及符号加载和超时行为。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-2vhrl58","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-2vhrl58","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"推荐怎么讲这个项目的面试故事线？"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-t732h3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-t732h3s","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我会按这个顺序讲。先说项目背景和痛点，为什么需要远程化 CDB；然后讲整体架构，MCP、REST、Web 到 Tools 到 Core 到 cdb.exe；接着讲一条完整链路，上传、SHA1、session、命令、解析；然后展开几个重点难点，大文件流式上传、子进程边界、线程池桥接、符号缓存和结构化输出；最后讲测试策略、已知不足和下一步改进。核心是始终回答三个问题：为什么需要这个设计、它具体解决了什么问题、规模变化时哪里先出问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-7hjql2g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-7hjql2g","updated":"20260902171815"}},{"ID":"20260902171815-g07den6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-g07den6","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附录：面试速查表"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-6iuj9cz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-6iuj9cz","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"技术主线"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-emyd739","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 主题 | 关键技术 | 一句话回答 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ASGI 框架 | Starlette + Uvicorn | 异步 HTTP 路由 + 中间件 |\n| MCP 协议 | FastMCP | 7 个 tool + 3 个 prompt |\n| 调试器 | cdb.exe (Windows) | WinDbg 命令行版 |\n| 文件存储 | SHA1 去重 + 流式 | 8MB 分块 + 一次性 token |\n| 符号缓存 | symstore.exe | 串行索引 + 后台线程 |\n| 异步桥接 | ThreadPoolExecutor | 阻塞 IO 不卡事件循环 |\n| 边界检测 | marker + UUID | 完成检测 + 内容切片 |\n| 输出过滤 | strip_noise + apply_terminal_cr | 去 CDB 噪音 + 模拟终端 |\n| 元数据 | JSON 持久化 | 延迟刷盘 + 原子替换 |\n| 清理 | DiskCleaner | LRU + 过期 + 活跃保护 |","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-emyd739","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主题"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键技术"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一句话回答"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ASGI 框架"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette + Uvicorn"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异步 HTTP 路由 + 中间件"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP 协议"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"FastMCP"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7 个 tool + 3 个 prompt"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调试器"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"cdb.exe (Windows)"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"WinDbg 命令行版"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文件存储"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SHA1 去重 + 流式"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8MB 分块 + 一次性 token"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"符号缓存"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"symstore.exe"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"串行索引 + 后台线程"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异步桥接"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ThreadPoolExecutor"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阻塞 IO 不卡事件循环"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"边界检测"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"marker + UUID"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"完成检测 + 内容切片"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出过滤"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"strip_noise + apply_terminal_cr"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去 CDB 噪音 + 模拟终端"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"元数据"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"JSON 持久化"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"延迟刷盘 + 原子替换"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清理"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DiskCleaner"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LRU + 过期 + 活跃保护"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-y72xqeb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-y72xqeb","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7 个 MCP 工具"}]},{"ID":"20260902171815-6o075ej","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 工具 | 类型 | 主要参数 | 主要返回 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `tool_upload` | 同步 | `file_type` | `upload_url`, `token`, `curl` |\n| `tool_import_from_url` | 异步 | `url`, `file_type` | `sha1`, `size_bytes` |\n| `tool_query` | 同步 | `command`, `session_id`, `sha1` | 列表/详情/帮助 |\n| `tool_execute_cdb` | 异步 | `dump_sha1`, `commands`, `timeout` | `outputs[]` |\n| `tool_create_session` | 异步 | `dump_sha1`, `initial_commands`, `prefetch_symbols` | `session_id`, `dump_info` |\n| `tool_session_exec` | 异步 | `session_id`, `commands`, `presets`, `strip_noise`, `max_output_lines` | `outputs[]` / `preset_results[]` |\n| `tool_close_session` | 同步 | `session_id` | `status: \"ok\"` |","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260902171815-6o075ej","updated":"20260902171815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"工具"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"类型"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要参数"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要返回"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_upload"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell